  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Resourceful_Lib/BH_NU_HEADER.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"284\"></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Resourceful_Lib/BH_NU_BANNER1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"142\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">Resourceful Lib 是一个模组开发库，包含了由 Team Resourceful 开发的实用工具和 API。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">截至撰写本文时，已有几款模组使用了该库，包括 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/resourceful-bees\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Resourceful Bees</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cozy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cozy</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vitalize\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vitalize</a> 等等！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Resourceful_Lib/BH_NU_BANNER2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"144\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">            📺 GL 裁剪 API</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">            📝 状态与历史屏幕管理器</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">            📠 谓词、标签、配方、集合及随机集合的编解码器</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">            🎨 颜色 API</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">            🌐 跨平台网络通信</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">            📲 编解码配方</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">            📁 JSON 文件工具</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">            💾 内存资源包与数据包</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">            🎲 随机集合/列表</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">            ⌛ 调度 API</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">            🌎 Web 工具</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">            📑 YABN（另一种二进制表示法）是 JSON 的一种压缩二进制格式，可实现较小的 JSON 对象传输体积</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">            📐 高亮 API（自定义非立方体绑定选择框）<br></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/resourcefulbees\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Resourceful_Lib/BH_NU_BANNER3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"144\"></span></span></a></span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fteamresourceful\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Resourceful_Lib/BH_NU_PROMO.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"362\"></a></p>",
